f:["$","div",null,{"className":"nkNtYW_note","children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Wherever you live."}]," We sell worldwide, and this policy applies to every buyer in every country. Some countries, including those of the European Union and the United Kingdom, give buyers a period to cancel an online purchase. For digital content, that right ends once the content is delivered with your consent. At checkout you agree to immediate access and acknowledge this. Any right your own country's law gives you still applies. We still honour every case on this page."]}]}]
10:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Bank transfers that do not match"}]
11:["$","p",null,{"children":"If you pay by bank transfer and send the wrong amount, or pay after the account number has expired, the payment is not accepted and the payment processor returns the money to the account it came from, usually within a few working days. If it has not arrived after 5 working days, email us with the date, the amount and your bank, and we will trace it."}]
12:["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to ask"}]
13:["$","p",null,{"children":["Email ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:lawofruin@gmail.com","children":"lawofruin@gmail.com"}]," from the address you bought with. Include your receipt or the payment reference and a sentence on what happened. We reply within 3 working days."]}]
14:["$","h2",null,{"children":"How the money comes back"}]
15:["$","p",null,{"children":"Approved refunds are made through the payment processor to the card or bank account you paid from, for the amount you paid in the currency you paid. We start the refund within 5 working days of approving it. Your bank then takes, usually, 5 to 10 working days to show it; international cards can take longer. Your access to that investigation ends when the refund is made."}]
16:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before a chargeback"}]
17:["$","p",null,{"children":"Please write to us first. Almost every problem is settled faster by email than through a dispute with your bank, and a refund we make ourselves reaches you sooner."}]
